# Stage 3 — Unified diagnostics, reporting and verification

## Scope and baseline evidence

Repository: SMozaff/Onyx-Framework. This audit inspected main at e59993389ff68bdc851a827d36b9392d3d40c649.

- Stage 1 PR #280: branch head ac1a2fe5317161cef1e18956164c54d2be1e25dc; merge commit 28770927087783e930ecaeafbbebc4fa4e9c1d4d. It added the Admin Shell login registry/classifier, request ID on its login request, safe user-facing code/reference text, and Worker login-boundary events.
- Stage 2 PR #281: branch head e8bcde615b319392ffbf3262376cd0a07b2df19e; merge commit ff1565b65d4a639f7116233fc0c1070018ffd7c9. It added non-login Worker request-boundary diagnostics, bounded route groups and HTTP status classifications.
- Later Stage 2 test-fixture corrections: merge commit f411f1df1626bb36995aad7697612cb4dc5bb1a4 fixed the relay-upgrade fixture; current base commit e59993389ff68bdc851a827d36b9392d3d40c649 fixed the diagnostics auth test's missing test-only ONYX_JWT_SECRET. Neither change changes production credentials or the login response contract.
